heckbox" class="accent-accent" name="rules.0.tools" value="read_file"/>read_file</label><label class="flex items-center gap-2"><input type="checkbox" class="accent-accent" name="rules.0.tools" value="grep"/>grep</label><label class="flex items-center gap-2"><input type="checkbox" class="accent-accent" name="rules.0.tools" value="write_file"/>write_file</label><label class="flex items-center gap-2"><input type="checkbox" class="accent-accent" name="rules.0.tools" value="edit_file"/>edit_file</label></fieldset><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><label for="rules.0.paths" class="font-semibold">パスのパターン</label><p id="rules.0.paths-hint" class="text-meta">1 行に 1 つ書きます。空なら、すべてのパスが対象です。</p><textarea id="rules.0.paths" name="rules.0.paths" rows="3" aria-describedby="rules.0.paths-hint" class="w-full rounded-control border px-3 control-py-2 transition duration-160 ease-out outline-none border-edge focus-visible:shadow-ring">.env</textarea></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><label for="rules.0.effect" class="font-semibold">扱い</label><select id="rules.0.effect" name="rules.0.effect" class="w-full rounded-control border px-3 control-py-2 transition duration-160 ease-out outline-none border-edge focus-visible:shadow-ring"><option value="deny" selected="">拒否する</option><option value="allow">許可する</option></select></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><label for="rules.0.reason" class="font-semibold">理由</label><input id="rules.0.reason" type="text" class="w-full rounded-control border px-3 control-py-2 transition duration-160 ease-out outline-none border-edge focus-visible:shadow-ring" name="rules.0.reason" value="Secrets stay private."/></div><div><button type="submit" value="remove-rule:0" class="inline-block cursor-pointer rounded-control px-4 control-py-2 font-semibold transition duration-160 ease-out focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-accent border border-edge hover:bg-edge" name="intent">このルールを消す</button></div></fieldset><div><button